			],
			"Message": "feat(Element): Advance Element submodule with document loading and dialog selection\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to include:\n\n**Cocoon**: Implement real document loading and message dialog selection.\n- Enhance Window service message dialogs (showInformationMessage, showWarningMessage, showErrorMessage) to properly handle the items parameter by sending gRPC requests with items to Mountain and returning the selected item from the response\n- Enhance Workspace service openTextDocument to fetch actual file content from Mountain via fs.readFile instead of returning mock data\n- Implement full TextDocument interface with proper getText(range), lineAt, offsetAt, positionAt, validateRange, validatePosition methods\n- Add language detection based on file extension mapping\n- Add workspace folder DTO conversion to VSCode.WorkspaceFolder objects in AcceptWorkspaceData handler\n- Remove stale TODO comments about event stream emitters and WorkspaceConfiguration that have been addressed\n\nThis enables real file content to be displayed in the editor with proper language detection.",
			"SHA": "9537036ceaab8da90544d5eca6648f8462ea45f3"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
